  "summary": "Calculate Anything is a PHP-based Alfred 5 natural-language workflow for currency, cryptocurrency, unit, data-storage, percentage, px/em/rem, time and VAT conversions, configurable via the Alfred 5 configuration panel (or environment variables under Alfred 4) and dependent on Fixer.io and CoinMarketCap API keys. Evidence is documentation-only (README, README-ALFRED4, CHANGELOG); two prior claims were revised to drop uncited version numbers.",
